le=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_old_soft_curved_padlock.\" title=\"The old soft curved padlock.\">The old soft curved padlock.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Tarpeters.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/One_warm_prawn.\" title=\"One warm prawn.\">One warm prawn.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/BMXing!\" title=\"BMXing!\">BMXing!</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/H.\" title=\"H.\">H.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/We_met_at_mealtimes.\" title=\"We met at mealtimes.\">We met at mealtimes.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Roadkill_doused_in_syrup.\" title=\"Roadkill doused in syrup.\">Roadkill doused in syrup.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/What_kind_of_pictures%3F\" title=\"What kind of pictures?\">What kind of pictures?</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Bubble_Brothers.\" title=\"The Bubble Brothers.\">The Bubble Brothers.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/He_was_a_different_man.\" title=\"He was a different man.\">He was a different man.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Tarpeters.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a7/Tarpeters..png/revision/latest?cb=20210210192541\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Tarpeters.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a7/Tarpeters..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210210192541\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a7/Tarpeters..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210210192541 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/a/a7/Tarpeters..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210210192541 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Tarpeters.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Tarpeters..png\" data-image-name=\"Tarpeters..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_6\" title=\"Series 6\">6</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Liza_Tarbuck\" title=\"Liza Tarbuck\">Liza Tarbuck</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_old_soft_curved_padlock.\" title=\"The old soft curved padlock.\">The old soft curved padlock.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/One_warm_prawn.\" title=\"One warm prawn.\">One warm prawn.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Tarpeters.</b></i> is the second episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_6\" title=\"Series 6\">Series 6</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 9 May 2018. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Liza_Tarbuck\" title=\"Liza Tarbuck\">Liza Tarbuck</a>. She also coined the episode's title, making this the first episode to be both won and named by the same person.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Tarpeters.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Tarpeters\" was an item that <a href=\"/wiki/Liza_Tarbuck\" title=\"Liza Tarbuck\">Liza Tarbuck</a> thought might be useful during the <a href=\"/wiki/Keep_Alex_dry\" title=\"Keep Alex dry\">Keep Alex dry</a> task, misremembering the name for tarpaulin. This is the first episode to be named after a quote said by the contestant who also wins said episode. The \"little man\" from the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_this_wind-up_little_man_go_on_the_most_extraordinary_journey\" title=\"Make this wind-up little man go on the most extraordinary journey\">Make this wind-up little man go on the most extraordinary journey</a> is used for the title card.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Tarpeters.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Gulvtæpper', which translates as 'Carpets'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Perssut', which translates as 'Winepresses'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Pretsenning'. This is an intentional mis-spelling of the word 'presenning' ('tarpaulin'). Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Tarpeters.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Alice_Levine\" title=\"Alice Levine\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Alice Levine</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Asim_Chaudhry\" title=\"Asim Chaudhry\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Asim Chaudhry</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Liza_Tarbuck\" title=\"Liza Tarbuck\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Liza Tarbuck</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Russell_Howard\" title=\"Russell Howard\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Russell Howard</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Vine\" title=\"Tim Vine\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Tim Vine</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_hairy_thing_that_isn%27t_alive\" title=\"Best hairy thing that isn&#39;t alive\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best hairy thing that isn't alive.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_the_highest_score_in_darts\" title=\"Get the highest score in darts\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get the highest score in darts. You can either throw one dart from 1 metre away, three darts from 2.37 metres away, or sixty darts from 10 metres away. When throwing, please stand behind whichever distance line you choose.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Keep_Alex_dry\" title=\"Keep Alex dry\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Keep Alex dry. You may not touch Alex at any point. You may not be within the compass when the shower is on.\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>4</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Take_a_picture_of_a_group_of_people,_each_holding_an_egg\" title=\"Take a picture of a group of people, each holding an egg\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Take a picture of a group of people, each holding an egg. Most people holding eggs in a picture wins. You must be in your picture.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_this_wind-up_little_man_go_on_the_most_extraordinary_journey\" title=\"Make this wind-up little man go on the most extraordinary journey\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make this wind-up little man go on the most extraordinary journey.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Put_your_grape_in_either_your_mouth_or_your_hand\" title=\"Put your grape in either your mouth or your hand\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> When instructed, put your grape in either your mouth or your hand whilst staring at the Taskmaster. You must then answer the Taskmaster's questions and fool the Taskmaster into thinking your grape is not where your grape is. You must not eat your grape. Your answer must contain at least five words. If the Taskmaster correctly guesses correctly where your grape is, you are eliminated.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>19</b>\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video\">Video</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Video\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Tarpeters.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Video\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" 